id: precision-kata
name: Precision Kata
talentCategory: specialization
prerequisites: Archetype Focus, Insight Score of 5+
description: >
  Trained to increase your accuracy in your chosen type of attack, your blows land precisely where you mean for them to.
text: >
  Precision Kata: Trained to increase your accuracy in your chosen type of attack, your blows land precisely where you mean for them to.
  –Prerequisites: Archetype Focus, Insight Score of 5+
  (1)-[Passive]: Reduce the Critical Target by 1 for your Strike Rolls for an Attacking Maneuver of your Focused Foundation.
  (2)-[Triggered]: If you score a Critical Result on your Strike Roll for an Attacking Maneuver made with your Focused Foundation, increase your Wound Roll for that Attacking Maneuver by 2(T).

---

[passive]
# (1) The Focused Foundation's Strike, its Critical Target 1 lower.
if (focusedOn("physical")) {
    criticalTarget.physical -= 1;
}
if (focusedOn("energy")) {
    criticalTarget.energy -= 1;
}
if (focusedOn("magic")) {
    criticalTarget.magic -= 1;
}
# (2) Its Strike a Critical Result: 2(T) on that attack's Wound, a row of its own (chat.mjs woundParts).
allow precisionKata.wound;
